From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReplayMod-LegacyFabric <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:24:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix unmapped GuiButton.x when remapping 1.14.4-forge to
 1.12.2

The MCP snapshot used for 1.14.4-forge has no name for Widget.x, so it
leaked into the preprocessed sources as func_214457_x and broke the
1.8.9 - 1.12.2 builds.

diff --git a/versions/mapping-forge-1.14.4-1.12.2.txt b/versions/mapping-forge-1.14.4-1.12.2.txt
index f439858e90..b450d622cb 100644
--- a/versions/mapping-forge-1.14.4-1.12.2.txt
+++ b/versions/mapping-forge-1.14.4-1.12.2.txt
@@ -52,3 +52,4 @@ net.minecraft.util.Hand net.minecraft.util.EnumHand
 net.minecraft.network.play.server.SUpdateRecipesPacket net.minecraft.network.play.server.SPacketRecipeBook
 net.minecraft.network.play.server.SOpenHorseWindowPacket net.minecraft.network.play.server.SPacketOpenWindow
 net.minecraft.network.play.server.SWindowPropertyPacket net.minecraft.network.play.server.SPacketWindowItems
+net.minecraft.client.gui.widget.Widget func_214457_x net.minecraft.client.gui.GuiButton x
